# Tooling & Global Config

## API

- Global prefix: `/api` — no versioning.
- Swagger mounted at `/api/docs`.
- Every endpoint must have Swagger decorators (`@ApiOperation`, `@ApiBody`, `@ApiResponse` variants). No exceptions.
- Logging: NestJS native `Logger` from `@nestjs/common`. No external logging libraries for now.

## ESLint

Base: `@typescript-eslint/recommended-type-checked`.

Required rules:

```json
{
  "@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any": "error",
  "@typescript-eslint/explicit-function-return-type": "error",
  "@typescript-eslint/consistent-type-imports": "error",
  "@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars": "error",
  "@typescript-eslint/naming-convention": [
    "error",
    { "selector": "variable",      "format": ["camelCase"] },
    { "selector": "function",      "format": ["camelCase"] },
    { "selector": "parameter",     "format": ["camelCase"] },
    { "selector": "classProperty", "format": ["camelCase"] },
    { "selector": "method",        "format": ["camelCase"] },
    { "selector": "class",         "format": ["PascalCase"] },
    { "selector": "interface",     "format": ["PascalCase"], "prefix": ["I"] },
    { "selector": "typeAlias",     "format": ["PascalCase"], "prefix": ["T"] }
  ]
}
```

## Prettier

Runs as a **separate script**, not as an ESLint rule (keeps linting fast).

```json
{
  "singleQuote": true,
  "trailingComma": "all",
  "printWidth": 100,
  "semi": true
}
```

```json
"scripts": {
  "lint":   "eslint \"{src,apps,libs,test}/**/*.ts\"",
  "format": "prettier --write \"{src,apps,libs,test}/**/*.ts\""
}
```

## CI (GitHub Actions)

Runs on every Pull Request and every push to `main`.
Pipeline: **lint → test → test:e2e** (in that order).

## Git conventions

| | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Branch | `feat/<feature-name>` | `feat/auth-refresh-token` |
| Commit | `feat: <description>` | `feat: add refresh token whitelist` |

Use descriptive commit messages and confirm with the user before committing.
